@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### Ruta base versionada
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/house
Accept: application/json

### Conexión a la base de datos
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/house/database
Accept: application/json

### CORS origen no permitido
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/house
Origin: http://origen-no-permitido.example
Accept: application/json

### CORS origen permitido
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/house
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Accept: application/json
